1
00:00:00,151 --> 00:00:02,821
(Sheldon:)...and I was forced to issue
an undeserved apology...

2
00:00:02,987 --> 00:00:07,367
...because I refused to urinate in
a stainless-steel bowl in front of criminals.

3
00:00:08,117 --> 00:00:10,327
(Howard:)Plus, you didn't get to meet Stan Lee.

4
00:00:12,038 --> 00:00:15,038
(Leonard:)Okay, that's enough, Howard.
The poor guy's had a tough time.

5
00:00:15,207 --> 00:00:19,007
(Leonard:)He had to spend the entire afternoon
in jail wearing that suit.

6
00:00:21,797 --> 00:00:25,347
(Howard:)It would be cruel to mention that,
after he finished signing autographs...

7
00:00:25,509 --> 00:00:28,849
(Howard:)...Stan Lee took Stuart and us out
for gelato.

8
00:00:30,348 --> 00:00:33,018
(Sheldon:)You had gelato with Stan Lee?

9
00:00:33,351 --> 00:00:36,311
(Howard:)He said we could call him Stan.

10
00:00:37,229 --> 00:00:38,359
(Leonard:)Except for Raj.

11
00:00:43,027 --> 00:00:45,487
(Sheldon:)Well, I hope you're satisfied, Penny.

12
00:00:45,655 --> 00:00:50,365
(Sheldon:)You are responsible for all the evil
that has befallen me today.

13
00:00:50,534 --> 00:00:52,034
(Penny:)-I realize--
SHELDON: Not finished.

14
00:00:52,203 --> 00:00:55,373
(Sheldon:)It is because of you
that I now have a criminal record.

15
00:00:55,539 --> 00:00:59,459
(Sheldon:)And it is because of you that I missed out
on having gelato with Stan Lee.

